{"title":"Virginia mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Virginia_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Virginia elementary school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Virginia_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Virginia middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Virginia_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Virginia high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Virginia_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\">Virginia elementary school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Virginia_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Virginia elementary school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.mamts.org\">MAMTS (Division E)</a> -- Mid-Atlantic Math Tournament Series hosts in-person math tournaments in fall and spring</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Virginia_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">Virginia middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Virginia_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Virginia middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=298\">middle school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Virginia_MathCounts\" title=\"Virginia MathCounts\">Virginia MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.integirls.org\">inteGIRLS</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dc.integirls.org\">D.C.</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Intermediate_Math_Open\" title=\"Intermediate Math Open\">Intermediate Math Open</a> -- Middle school competition hosted by TJHSST</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Virginia_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Virginia Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Virginia Mathematics League</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.mamts.org\">MAMTS (Division M)</a> -- Mid-Atlantic Math Tournament Series hosts in-person math tournaments in fall and spring</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Virginia_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">Virginia high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Virginia_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Virginia high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=214\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fairfax_County_Math_League\" title=\"Fairfax County Math League\">Fairfax County Math League</a> (FCML)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.integirls.org\">inteGIRLS</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dc.integirls.org\">D.C.</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=James_Madison_University_Mathematics_and_Science_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"James Madison University Mathematics and Science Contest (page does not exist)\">James Madison University Mathematics and Science Contest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Virginia_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Virginia Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Virginia Mathematics League</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Virginia_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Virginia_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017132310\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 26/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransc